<%- include('partials/head', { title, user, activeNav: 'home' }) %>
<div class="container wide">

  <section style="padding:56px 0 20px;text-align:center;">
    <h1 style="font:400 clamp(36px,6vw,58px) var(--font-display);letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;text-wrap:balance;text-shadow:0 2px 0 #000, 0 0 30px rgba(240,180,41,.3);">
      Play the herd. <span style="color:var(--gold);">Chase the charge.</span>
    </h1>
    <p style="max-width:680px;margin:16px auto 0;color:var(--dim);font-size:17px;">
      Winners Gaming Club is a members' room for two original slot designs — <strong>Golden Charge</strong> and
      <strong>Thunder Herd</strong> — built on exact-math-tuned, Monte-Carlo-validated engines and played entirely
      with free Club Credits. No card ever touches this site.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:22px;">
      <% if (user) { %>
        <a class="btn primary" href="/play">Go to the floor</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a class="btn primary" href="/signup">Join free — get a signup bonus</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/login">Log in</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid-3" style="margin:34px 0;">
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="color:var(--gold2);margin-top:0;">Club Credits, always</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);font-size:14px;margin:0;">Every balance on this site is a Club Credit. Nothing here
      can be bought, deposited, cashed out, or exchanged for money — it exists purely for play.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="color:var(--gold2);margin-top:0;">Ledger, not a number</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);font-size:14px;margin:0;">Your balance is never a single stored figure — it's the
      running sum of an append-only ledger of every bonus, spin, win, and adjustment. See it yourself in
      <a href="<%= user ? '/history' : '/signup' %>">your transaction history</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="color:var(--gold2);margin-top:0;">A real support team</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);font-size:14px;margin:0;">Every account is looked after by a real person on staff —
      open a <a href="/chat">support chat</a> any time, whether you're curious how a feature works, want more Club
      Credits, or want to talk about <a href="/responsible-play">setting a limit</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card" style="margin:34px 0;border-color:var(--gold);border-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--gold) 35%, var(--border));">
    <h3 style="color:var(--gold2);margin-top:0;">The house always has the edge — that's the point</h3>
    <p style="color:var(--dim);font-size:14px;max-width:760px;">Both games are tuned to a published RTP around 96%,
    meaning that for every 100 credits wagered, the math returns about 96 on average — the other 4 are gone for
    good, every time, no matter how any single spin or session feels. <strong>If these were real dollars, that 4%
    would be real money lost for nothing but the feeling of another spin</strong> — that's not a flaw to hide, it's
    exactly how every slot machine, real or simulated, actually works, and it compounds fast the longer you play. If
    tracking a session ever stops feeling fun, <a href="/responsible-play">this page</a> has real resources and lets
    you set a limit in seconds.</p>
  </section>

  <h2 class="section-title" id="the-games">The floor</h2>
  <section class="grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--gold2);font-family:var(--font-display);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em;font-weight:400;font-size:22px;">Golden Charge</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);">A wild-collector game. Land two or more Bulls and a Charge Hit fires: <strong>every
      Bull collects the full value of every visible Gold Coin</strong>, then flips into a silver coin for a second
      prize. Three or more Ranch Gates open a free-games round on hotter reels.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--gold2);font-family:var(--font-display);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em;font-weight:400;font-size:22px;">Thunder Herd</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);">A hold-&amp;-respin game. Six or more Money Bulls lock the grid and start 3
      respins that reset on every new prize. Collector Bulls sweep up everything already revealed; Diamond Bulls
      open a second Stampede phase chasing the Grand.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2 class="section-title">Symbols &amp; payouts</h2>
  <p style="color:var(--dim);max-width:760px;">Both games play 30 fixed lines left to right. Pays below are shown at
  the 30-credit reference bet — pick any bet size on the floor and every payout scales with it. Figures are pulled
  live from the same engine code that runs on the floor, not typed in by hand.</p>
  <div class="grid-2" id="payoutTables"><p style="color:var(--dim);">Loading paytables…</p></div>

  <h2 class="section-title">How Club Credits work</h2>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--gold2);">1. Sign up</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);font-size:14px;">Every new account starts with a fixed 20 Club Credits, automatically
      — no card, no form, no amount to choose.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--gold2);">2. Play it out</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);font-size:14px;">Spin at any bet size the floor allows. Every credit you win or lose
      is its own line in your <a href="<%= user ? '/history' : '/signup' %>">transaction history</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--gold2);">3. Run low? Ask.</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);font-size:14px;">Down to zero? Open a <a href="/chat">support chat</a> instead of a
      deposit screen — a real person on the team can top you back up.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">FAQ</h2>
  <div id="faqList">
    <details class="card" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold2);">Is any of this real money?</summary>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);">No. Every credit is a Club Credit with no cash value. There is no deposit method,
      no withdrawal method, and no path anywhere in this platform that converts a Club Credit into real currency.</p></details>
    <details class="card" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold2);">What does RTP mean?</summary>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);">Return to player — the long-run share of turnover a game pays back on average.
      Both games here are tuned to a published target using exact combinatorics and checked against tens of millions
      of simulated rounds before they're ever offered to play.</p></details>
    <details class="card" style="margin-bottom:10px;"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold2);">How is my balance calculated?</summary>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);">It's never stored as a single editable number. Every bonus, stake, win, and manual
      adjustment is its own permanent row in a ledger, and your balance is the sum of all of them — the same
      discipline a real gambling ledger is held to, applied here even though nothing is real money.</p></details>
    <details class="card"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold2);">I'm at zero. What now?</summary>
      <p style="color:var(--dim);">Open a <a href="/chat">support chat</a> and ask — no deposit screen, just a
      conversation with the team running the club.</p></details>
  </div>

  <section style="text-align:center;padding:44px 0 20px;">
    <% if (!user) { %>
      <a class="btn primary" href="/signup">Join Winners Gaming Club</a>
    <% } else { %>
      <a class="btn primary" href="/play">Back to the floor</a>
    <% } %>
  </section>
</div>
<script>window.WGC_PAYDATA = <%- JSON.stringify(payData) %>;</script>
<script type="module" src="/js/home.js"></script>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
